#. Manage Classes
#: src/include/autoinstall/classes.rb:187
msgid "Classes"
msgstr "ຄລາສ"

#: src/include/autoinstall/classes.rb:189
msgid "<p>Use this interface to define classes of control files. </p>\n"
msgstr "<p>ໃຊ້ສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ນີ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າຄລາສຂອງໄຟລ໌ຄວບຄຸມ. </p>\n"

#: src/include/autoinstall/classes.rb:195
msgid ""
"<p>For example, you can define a class of configurations for\n"
"a specific  department, group, or site in your company environment.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>ຕົວຢ່າງ, ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດຄລາສຂອງການກຳນົດຄ່າສຳລັບ\n"
"ຜະແນກ, ກຸ່ມ ຫຼື ສະຖານທີ່ໃດໜຶ່ງໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມບໍລິສັດຂອງທ່ານ.</p>\n"

#: src/include/autoinstall/classes.rb:203
msgid ""
"<p>The order (priority) defines the hierarchy of a class\n"
"and when it is merged when creating a control file.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>ລຳດັບ (ບຸລິມະສິດ) ກຳນົດລຳດັບຊັ້ນຂອງຄລາສ\n"
"ແລະ ກຳນົດວ່າມັນຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າກັນຕອນໃດໃນເວລາສ້າງໄຟລ໌ຄວບຄຸມ.\n"
"</p>\n"

#: src/include/autoinstall/classes.rb:232
msgid "No Description"
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີຄຳອະທິບາຍ"

#: src/include/autoinstall/classes.rb:245
