"Select at least one class\n"
"to edit.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງຄລາສ\n"
"ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂ.\n"

#: src/include/autoinstall/classes.rb:252
