#. Checks whether an ERB profile can be rendered according to the given options
#.
#. An ERB can be rendered if the check-profile command is run without root permissions. If it
#. is run as root, then the option run-erb=true must be given.
#.
#. @param filename [String] filename of the AutoYaST profile
#. @param run_erb_option [String] the given run-erb option
#.
#. @return [Boolean]
#: src/lib/autoinstall/clients/autoyast.rb:241
msgid "run-erb=true option is mandatory when checking an ERB profile as root."
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກ run-erb=true ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນເມື່ອກວດສອບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ ERB ໃນຖານະ root."

#: src/lib/autoinstall/clients/autoyast.rb:248
msgid "The ERB profile cannot be rendered with run-erb=false."
msgstr "ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ ERB ບໍ່ສາມາດປະມວນຜົນ (render) ໄດ້ດ້ວຍ run-erb=false."

